The [[Vampiric Potion]] is a neutral [[Potion]] normally obtained by catalytically converting a [[Strong Health Potion]] using a [[Blood Amulet]]. When both characters are slightly damaged, the [[Vampiric Potion]] will be consumed, dealing some lifesteal damage and gaining some {{icon/vampirism}}, as well as applying the effects of the potion above. The numbers, choice of buffs, activation condition, and fact that it pressures the opponent's health arguably make it better than the [[Strong Health Potion]], but a build could care a lot about {{icon/regeneration}} and not at all about {{icon/vampirism}}, so it's not a pure upgrade.

[[Reaper]]s can catalytically convert a [[Vampiric Potion]] into a [[Strong Vampiric Potion]] using the [[Cauldron]].
